{
  "_note": [
    "The other half of the pin. awkward.tfstate.json covers the state-move path;",
    "this covers the drift-adoption path, where only the atlas snapshot exists.",
    "",
    "Every `subject.id` here is what the atlas collectors actually store — for",
    "several types that is an ARN, which is the whole defect:",
    "  sqs-queue    collect/messaging.ts:142  id: queueArn ?? queueUrl",
    "  lambda       collect/compute.ts:90     id: fn.FunctionArn ?? fn.FunctionName",
    "  ecs          collect/containers.ts:66  id: s.serviceArn!",
    "  waf-web-acl  collect/waf.ts:162        id: detail?.Id ?? acl.id  (bare id)",
    "  vpc          native id (the control — must never move)",
    "  iam-role     collect/iam.ts:87         id: r.RoleName",
    "",
    "expectedId is the value the provider documents for `terraform import`,",
    "read off website/docs/r/<type>.html.markdown on 2026-08-07. WP-B and WP-C",
    "are free to reuse this file; they are not free to change an expectedId",
    "without re-reading the doc page it cites."
  ],
  "subjects": [
    {
